  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">D&#xE5; nya Sida bildadesvaldes lokalerna med stor h&#xE4;nsyn till att extern informationsverksamhet skulle kunna berivas i dem. F&#xF6;r att lokalerna fritt skulle kunna disponeras av INFO &#xF6;verenskoms att INFO betalar en viss hyreskostnad per &#xE5;r f&#xF6;r dessa utrymmen fr&#xE5;n Infoanslaget till ADM. Hyran &#xE4;r en miljon per &#xE5;r.1999 hyran &#xE4;r 1.200.000:</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">When new Sida was formed the localities were chosen with great concernfor external information activities. For the Information Department tofreely use these localities was agreed that Info payed a certain rent the Dep of Administration. The cost is one million SEK per year.</narrative>
  </description>
